                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A princely state in alliance with British India until 1947, then a princely state of Pakistan until 1969. The area of the state now forms the Chitral District of the Malakand Division, Khyber-Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "historical"
                                        ],
